    "name": "Sailor Simulator: World War II",
    "steam_appid": 3456460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8b7ca6c0aacfe7d784bed5938122d60b.poster.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8b7ca6c0aacfe7d784bed5938122d60b.webm?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8b7ca6c0aacfe7d784bed5938122d60b.mp4?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World War II is engulfing the globe, with the Pacific Ocean ablaze in conflict. You\u2019ve just been enlisted in the navy, joining the crew of an American destroyer. As a crucial member of this team, you will participate in key operations against Imperial Japan.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/850997139bce7aa0436a3629e9a59a4a.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=100 /></span> Your destroyer is armed with iconic naval weapons from World War II, such as the Bofors, Oerlikon, 5-inch deck guns, torpedoes, and depth charges. Each weapon is portrayed with realistic detail. Master the art of maintaining, operating, and firing these classic armaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8203a410cd22836708bc6a29b6cc8996.poster.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8203a410cd22836708bc6a29b6cc8996.webm?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8203a410cd22836708bc6a29b6cc8996.mp4?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/b06209dd033dd2851159354e50dd372e.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=100 /></span> The vast expanse of the Pacific Ocean awaits. Navigating these waters requires precision and skill. Utilize maps, compasses, rangefinders, chronometers, and even the stars to chart your course through perilous seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/0c748651e0294442bf5edb6a57536289.poster.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/0c748651e0294442bf5edb6a57536289.webm?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/0c748651e0294442bf5edb6a57536289.mp4?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/6d6170503cedeeea0ebbf3a929a87d8e.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=100 /></span>The fog of war shrouds the oceans, making it essential to detect enemies while concealing your own position. Harness the electromagnetic spectrum to locate adversaries, use radars, eavesdrop enemie\u2019s radio communication and crack their codes when deploying smoke screens and encrypt your own signals to remain undetected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/ff1b18c7b4bc4a4d40142ecb6acdc34f.poster.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/ff1b18c7b4bc4a4d40142ecb6acdc34f.webm?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/ff1b18c7b4bc4a4d40142ecb6acdc34f.mp4?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/dce797b077f3a6b50ecd376bc68bb44d.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=100 /></span> War isn\u2019t just about combat; maintaining the ship and crew is vital. Someone must clean the deck, prepare meals, oil the guns, load supplies, paint the hull, and scrub the barnacles. Fulfilling these responsibilities will earn the respect of your superiors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/bf220090cb635a2a2962efa15740c3c9.poster.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/bf220090cb635a2a2962efa15740c3c9.webm?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/bf220090cb635a2a2962efa15740c3c9.mp4?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/6f0f99c7a16b9f29fc17882ebc1779ac.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=100 /></span>As part of the U.S. Navy, you\u2019ll play a role in the greatest naval conflict in history. Safeguard supply convoys, support island assaults, defend the skies from Japanese planes, and take down legendary warships of the Imperial forces.<br><br> <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve aboard a World War II American destroyer in the Pacific theater.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate iconic naval weapons like Bofors, Oerlikons, and torpedoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate treacherous waters using maps, compasses, and the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eavesdrop on enemy communications and crack Japanese codes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform essential daily tasks to maintain the ship and crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in historical missions, from convoy defense to island assaults. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8b7ca6c0aacfe7d784bed5938122d60b.poster.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8b7ca6c0aacfe7d784bed5938122d60b.webm?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8b7ca6c0aacfe7d784bed5938122d60b.mp4?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World War II is engulfing the globe, with the Pacific Ocean ablaze in conflict. You\u2019ve just been enlisted in the navy, joining the crew of an American destroyer. As a crucial member of this team, you will participate in key operations against Imperial Japan.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/850997139bce7aa0436a3629e9a59a4a.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=100 /></span> Your destroyer is armed with iconic naval weapons from World War II, such as the Bofors, Oerlikon, 5-inch deck guns, torpedoes, and depth charges. Each weapon is portrayed with realistic detail. Master the art of maintaining, operating, and firing these classic armaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8203a410cd22836708bc6a29b6cc8996.poster.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8203a410cd22836708bc6a29b6cc8996.webm?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/8203a410cd22836708bc6a29b6cc8996.mp4?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/b06209dd033dd2851159354e50dd372e.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=100 /></span> The vast expanse of the Pacific Ocean awaits. Navigating these waters requires precision and skill. Utilize maps, compasses, rangefinders, chronometers, and even the stars to chart your course through perilous seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/0c748651e0294442bf5edb6a57536289.poster.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/0c748651e0294442bf5edb6a57536289.webm?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/0c748651e0294442bf5edb6a57536289.mp4?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/6d6170503cedeeea0ebbf3a929a87d8e.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=100 /></span>The fog of war shrouds the oceans, making it essential to detect enemies while concealing your own position. Harness the electromagnetic spectrum to locate adversaries, use radars, eavesdrop enemie\u2019s radio communication and crack their codes when deploying smoke screens and encrypt your own signals to remain undetected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/ff1b18c7b4bc4a4d40142ecb6acdc34f.poster.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/ff1b18c7b4bc4a4d40142ecb6acdc34f.webm?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/ff1b18c7b4bc4a4d40142ecb6acdc34f.mp4?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/dce797b077f3a6b50ecd376bc68bb44d.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=100 /></span> War isn\u2019t just about combat; maintaining the ship and crew is vital. Someone must clean the deck, prepare meals, oil the guns, load supplies, paint the hull, and scrub the barnacles. Fulfilling these responsibilities will earn the respect of your superiors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/bf220090cb635a2a2962efa15740c3c9.poster.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/bf220090cb635a2a2962efa15740c3c9.webm?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/bf220090cb635a2a2962efa15740c3c9.mp4?t=1739627894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456460/extras/6f0f99c7a16b9f29fc17882ebc1779ac.avif?t=1739627894\" width=800 height=100 /></span>As part of the U.S. Navy, you\u2019ll play a role in the greatest naval conflict in history. Safeguard supply convoys, support island assaults, defend the skies from Japanese planes, and take down legendary warships of the Imperial forces.<br><br> <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve aboard a World War II American destroyer in the Pacific theater.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate iconic naval weapons like Bofors, Oerlikons, and torpedoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate treacherous waters using maps, compasses, and the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eavesdrop on enemy communications and crack Japanese codes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform essential daily tasks to maintain the ship and crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in historical missions, from convoy defense to island assaults. </p></li></ul>",
